<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>July Freedom Special | Rebel Ranch Ministries</title>
  <meta name="description" content="July Freedom Special by Faith Family & Nature Church and Rebel Ranch Ministries. Three programs. One affordable price. July only." />

  <!-- Social sharing (Open Graph / Twitter Card) -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="July Freedom Special — $250 | Rebel Ranch Ministries" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Fortune-500-trained operations help for $250, built for Gilchrist, Levy, Dixie & Suwannee families. July only." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://rebelranchministries.org/july-freedom-special.html" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://rebelranchministries.org/assets/july-freedom-special-share.jpg" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="July Freedom Special — $250 | Rebel Ranch Ministries" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Fortune-500-trained operations help for $250, built for Gilchrist, Levy, Dixie & Suwannee families. July only." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://rebelranchministries.org/assets/july-freedom-special-share.jpg" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #07120A;
      --charcoal: #0D1E15;
      --green: #97C459;
      --green-2: #4A7C59;
      --sage: #152A18;
      --sage-2: #102315;
      --white: #F0EDD8;
      --ink: #F0EDD8;
      --bone: #07120A;
      --gold: #C17F24;
      --gold-2: #EF9F27;
      --rust: #C17F24;
      --brown: #2A1A0A;
      --red: #bf1f2f;
      --blue: #0a2f67;
      --text: #F0EDD8;
      --muted: #B9B596;
      --line: #1E3A20;
      --shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.42);
      --radius: 30px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #152A18 0%, #07120A 35%, #050b06 100%);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }
    button, .btn { font-family: 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; }

    .container {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .landing-brand {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 5;
      top: 22px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .landing-logo {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .landing-logo img {
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45));
    }

    .landing-tag {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 950;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.7px;
      font-size: .78rem;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 720px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--black);
      border-bottom: 9px solid var(--gold);
    }

    .hero-photo {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 38%;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
    }

    .hero-shade {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 72% 23%, rgba(201,162,75,.16), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(105deg, rgba(7,8,6,.92) 0%, rgba(7,8,6,.82) 45%, rgba(15,25,17,.62) 100%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 120px 0 82px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 370px;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: block;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: .78rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.65rem, 9vw, 8rem);
      line-height: .86;
      letter-spacing: -.08em;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      max-width: 880px;
      text-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.48);
    }

    .hero-subhead {
      font-size: clamp(1.16rem, 2.2vw, 1.52rem);
      max-width: 800px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.96);
      margin: 0;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    }

    .gold-line {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.85vw, 2.25rem);
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
      margin: 26px 0 0;
      text-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.50);
    }

    .price-card {
      background: #0B1710;
      color: var(--ink);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid #294a2a;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 30px 24px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(100%, 370px);
    }

    .price-card .small {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      letter-spacing: 1.6px;
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .price-card .price {
      font-size: 6.7rem;
      line-height: .9;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.08em;
      margin: 12px 0;
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .price-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 850;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .countdown-wrap {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px dashed #264827;
    }

    .countdown-label {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      color: var(--rust);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .countdown {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .countdown .unit {
      background: #0D1E15;
      border: 1px solid #315235;
      color: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 2px 7px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .countdown .unit strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .countdown .unit span {
      display: block;
      font-size: .58rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .8px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .countdown-strip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(191,31,47,.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(191,31,47,.30);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 9px 16px 9px 10px;
      margin: 22px 0 0;
    }

    .countdown-strip .dot {
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--red);
      flex: none;
      animation: pulse-dot 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse-dot {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: .35; }
    }

    .countdown-strip .cd-text {
      font-weight: 950;
      font-size: .92rem;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .countdown-strip .cd-text b {
      color: var(--gold-2);
    }

    .location-line {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.94);
      text-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    }

    .location-line b { color: var(--gold-2); }

    .card-subtitle {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: .84rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .6px;
    }

    .trust-strip {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .trust-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 850;
      font-size: .95rem;
      color: var(--gold-2);
    }

    .trust-badge .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); flex: none; }

    .founder-note-centered .signed {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-weight: 950;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .founder-note-centered {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 40px auto 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.06rem;
      font-style: italic;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #201303, #0D1E15);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 42px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 13px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .hero .buttons { justify-content: flex-start; }

    .btn {
      appearance: none;
      border: 0;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 15px 23px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: .2px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: .18s ease;
      font-size: .98rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(17,18,15,.13);
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* Real-site button pattern: dark outline pill (default/secondary) or gold gradient pill (primary) */
    .btn-green,
    .btn-black,
    .btn-rust,
    .btn-white,
    .btn-outline {
      background: #142617;
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--green-2);
    }
    .btn-green:hover,
    .btn-black:hover,
    .btn-rust:hover,
    .btn-white:hover,
    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: #1b341f;
    }

    .btn-gold {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C17F24, #7b4b13);
      color: #fff7de;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    }
    .btn-gold:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d3922f, #8a5414);
    }

    section { padding: 76px 0; }

    .white { background: var(--charcoal); }
    .sage { background: var(--sage); }
    .green-section { background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0, #264827, #0D1E15 45%, #07120A); color: #fff; }
    .gold-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--gold-2) 100%); color: var(--brown); }
    .dark-section { background: var(--black); color: #fff; }

    h2 {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.85vw, 4.35rem);
      line-height: .94;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    h3 {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 1.42rem;
      line-height: 1.18;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .green-section h2,
    .green-section h3,
    .dark-section h2,
    .dark-section h3 { color: #fff; }

    .gold-section h2,
    .gold-section h3 { color: var(--black); }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.18rem;
      max-width: 920px;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .green-section .lead,
    .dark-section .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,.94); }

    .gold-section .lead { color: rgba(42,26,10,.88); }

    .center { text-align: center; }
    .center .lead { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

    .statement {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.3vw, 2.8rem);
      color: var(--rust);
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.05em;
      line-height: .98;
    }

    .split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .support-panel {
      background: var(--charcoal);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .skill-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .skill {
      background: rgba(13,30,21,.75);
      color: var(--gold-2);
      border: 1px solid #264827;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: .95rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .excellence-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-left: 8px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.13);
    }

    .excellence-card ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
    }

    .excellence-card li { margin: 8px 0; }

    .programs-intro {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto 34px;
    }

    .analysis-callout {
      display: block;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 30px auto 0;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 38px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #102315, #0A160D);
      border: 1px solid #284a29;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--green));
    }

    .card-head {
      padding: 24px 24px 6px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .card-head h3 {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .card-body {
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-self: flex-start;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(193,127,36,.18);
      color: var(--gold-2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(193,127,36,.45);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 950;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: .88rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .65px;
    }

    .plain-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 15px 0 0;
    }

    .plain-list li {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 11px 0;
    }

    .plain-list strong { color: var(--gold-2); }

    .card-footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 22px; }

    .payment-box {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.40);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.38);
      padding: 30px;
      border-left: 8px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(17,18,15,.10);
    }

    .rrm-logo-lockup {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 95px 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .rrm-logo-lockup img {
      width: 92px;
      height: 92px;
      object-fit: contain;
      background: var(--black);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .path-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .path-grid .path-tile {
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 14px);
      min-width: 260px;
      max-width: calc(50% - 7px);
    }

    .path-tile {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #102315, #0A160D);
      border: 1px solid #284a29;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 22px 22px 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: .18s ease;
    }

    .path-tile::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--green));
    }

    .path-tile:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .path-tile strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .path-tile span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .94rem;
    }

    .final-cta {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0, #264827, #0D1E15 45%, #07120A);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #385d33;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #385d33;
    }


    .final-cta h2 { color: #fff; }

    .freedom-line {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.6vw, 3.1rem);
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
      line-height: .98;
      margin: 22px auto 0;
      max-width: 980px;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
    }

    footer {
      width: min(1160px, 92vw);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 0 60px;
      color: #88836d;
      border-top: 1px solid #1d321e;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer .fbrand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    footer .ftag {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .socials {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 0 auto 26px;
    }

    .socials a {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--gold);
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #1c1204, #0A160D);
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      transition: .25s transform, .25s box-shadow, .25s background;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .socials a:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C17F24, #7b4b13);
      color: #fff7de;
      box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(193,127,36,.5);
    }

    .socials svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; fill: currentColor; }

    .footer-legal,
    .disclaimer {
      color: #88836d;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .modal-backdrop {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 2000;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(17,18,15,.82);
      padding: 22px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .modal-backdrop.active { display: block; }

    .modal {
      width: min(760px, 100%);
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: var(--sage-2);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.34);
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .modal-header {
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, var(--black), var(--green-2));
      color: #fff;
      padding: 26px 30px;
      border-bottom: 8px solid var(--gold);
    }

    .modal-header h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 2.12rem;
      margin: 0 46px 8px 0;
    }

    .modal-header p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); }

    .close-modal {
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px;
      right: 18px;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background: var(--rust);
      color: #fff;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    form { padding: 28px 30px 32px; }

    label {
      display: block;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 950;
      margin: 14px 0 7px;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(17,18,15,.24);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px 13px;
      font: inherit;
      background: #fff;
    }

    textarea { min-height: 112px; resize: vertical; }

    .form-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .checkbox-line {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .checkbox-line input { width: auto; margin-top: 5px; }

    .payment-plan-panel {
      display: none;
      background: var(--sage);
      border-left: 6px solid var(--gold);
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .payment-plan-panel.show { display: block; }

    .form-note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--sage);
      border-left: 7px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: .94rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid, .split, .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .price-card { justify-self: start; }
      .skill-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .landing-tag { display: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .landing-logo span { display: none; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; }
      .hero-grid { padding: 118px 0 58px; }
      .price-card { width: 100%; }
      .price-card .price { font-size: 5.4rem; }
      .buttons, .hero .buttons { justify-content: stretch; }
      .btn { width: 100%; }
      .skill-grid, .form-row, .rrm-logo-lockup { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .path-grid .path-tile { max-width: 100%; flex-basis: 100%; }
      .location-line { font-size: .92rem; }
      .countdown-strip { width: 100%; }
      .countdown-strip .cd-text { font-size: .8rem; }
      .trust-strip { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .trust-badge { justify-content: center; }
      .founder-note-centered { font-size: .96rem; padding: 16px 18px; }
      .analysis-callout { font-size: .95rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="landing-brand">
      <a class="landing-logo" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Rebel Ranch Ministries logo">
        <span>Rebel Ranch Ministries</span>
      </a>
      <div class="landing-tag">Faith · Family · Freedom</div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-photo" style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,');"></div>
    <div class="hero-shade"></div>

    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">July Special · America’s 250th Birthday</div>
        <h1>Freedom Special</h1>
        <p class="hero-subhead">
          For real Americans still pursuing the American Dream through small business,
          family income, homeschool programs, educational services, community resources,
          and practical life-skill opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="location-line">Proudly serving <b>Gilchrist, Levy, Dixie &amp; Suwannee</b> Counties — and families all across the <b>Gainesville area</b>.</div>

        <div class="gold-line">Real work. Real families. Real support.</div>

        <div class="countdown-strip">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="cd-text" id="heroCountdownText">Loading offer countdown…</span>
        </div>

        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#programs">See Programs</a>
          <button class="btn btn-black open-form" data-interest="Payment Plan Request">Ask About Payment Plans</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="price-card" aria-label="All July programs are $250">
        <div class="small">July Only · Limited Time</div>
        <div class="price">$250</div>
        <p>Choose the program. We customize the strategy around your business.</p>

        <div class="countdown-wrap">
          <div class="countdown-label">Offer Ends In</div>
          <div class="countdown" id="priceCardCountdown">
            <div class="unit"><strong id="cd-days">--</strong><span>Days</span></div>
            <div class="unit"><strong id="cd-hours">--</strong><span>Hrs</span></div>
            <div class="unit"><strong id="cd-mins">--</strong><span>Min</span></div>
            <div class="unit"><strong id="cd-secs">--</strong><span>Sec</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </header>


  <section class="white">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2>This Is What America Is All About</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        America was built by people who worked hard, sacrificed, farmed, built, repaired,
        taught, raised families, and kept going even when life got hard.
      </p>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        These programs are designed to provide more effective and efficient methods to jumpstart
        or boost your current business, class, service, or community project.
      </p>

      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        From Trenton to Bell, Old Town to Branford, Live Oak to Gainesville — Gilchrist,
        Levy, Dixie, and Suwannee Counties are full of people building something real.
        We built this offer for them.
      </p>

      <div class="statement">Real work. Real families. Real support.</div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="sage">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="support-panel">
        <h2>Professional Operations Support</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          This July offer brings practical operations, systems, and business-building support
          through Faith Family & Nature Church and Rebel Ranch Ministries. Program payments go directly
          to FFN and support FFN programs, Rebel Ranch Ministries, community education, and operational development.
        </p>

        <div class="skill-grid">
          <div class="skill">Operational Strategy & Management</div>
          <div class="skill">Lean / Six Sigma</div>
          <div class="skill">Operational Excellence</div>
          <div class="skill">Workflow, Systems & Process Improvement</div>
          <div class="skill">Efficiency, Effectiveness & Profitability</div>
          <div class="skill">Leadership, Communication & Team Development</div>
        </div>

        <div class="buttons">
          <button class="btn btn-gold open-form" data-interest="General July Program Request">Request a Program</button>
          <a class="btn btn-black" href="#programs">View July Offers</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="green-section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Corporate America's Playbook</div>
        <h2>Ever Wonder How They Get Rich?</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Six Sigma. Lean process. Operational excellence. These aren't buzzwords — they're the
          exact playbook Fortune 500 companies use to cut waste, protect profit, and scale faster
          than everyone else. They pay $150 to $500 an hour for it. The people who hold this
          certification average $180,000 a year in salary just to keep it in-house.
        </p>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          I could have kept climbing that ladder. The next title, the next raise, the next city.
          That was the trade on the table. To the company, I was just a dollar sign. To my
          daughter — I'm EVERYTHING. So I hung up my heels and came home to what matters.
        </p>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          Same methodology. Same discipline that keeps multi-million-dollar operations running
          smoothly. Priced at $250, for the businesses and families who were never supposed to
          get access to it. No one else in this region is offering this. Not this background.
          Not this price.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="excellence-card">
        <h3>Who's Actually Behind This</h3>
        <p>
          This isn't outsourced or generic. It's brought to you personally by a Certified
          Lean Six Sigma Master Black Belt with 10+ years fixing broken systems inside
          regulated, high-stakes operations — now bringing that same skill home to Gilchrist
          County and the families around it, priced so it's actually within reach.
        </p>

        <div class="trust-strip">
          <span class="trust-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Certified Six Sigma Master Black Belt</span>
          <span class="trust-badge"><span class="dot"></span>10+ Years Operations Leadership</span>
          <span class="trust-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Ordained Minister</span>
          <span class="trust-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Serving Gilchrist, Levy, Dixie &amp; Suwannee</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="founder-note-centered">
        "I'm bringing corporate America's secrets back to my tribe — the hardworking Americans
        busting their butts day in and day out for the American Dream."
        <span class="signed">— Brooklyn Ritchie, Founder</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="programs" class="white">
    <div class="container center">
      <div class="programs-intro">
        <h2>Three Programs. One Affordable Price.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Choose the program that fits your need. Then we customize the business analysis,
          strategy, tools, and Custom Action Plan around your business, class, service, or project —
          so the work fits what you are actually building.
        </p>

        <div class="analysis-callout">
          Every July program includes a full business analysis and Custom Action Plan.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3>Bring Home The Bacon</h3>
            <span class="card-subtitle">Business Operations &amp; Optimization</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="tag">July only · limited time</span>
            <p>
              For small businesses, makers, tradespeople, home businesses, and local providers
              who want to improve their operations and income.
            </p>

            <ul class="plain-list">
              <li><strong>Business analysis:</strong> focused review of strengths, weaknesses, gaps, bottlenecks, and money leaks.</li>
              <li><strong>Operational Excellence Plan:</strong> practical steps to streamline work, improve flow, and reduce wasted time.</li>
              <li><strong>Online presence:</strong> review what customers see, where they contact you, and how clearly your offer is presented.</li>
              <li><strong>Customer Relationship Management:</strong> identify how you attract, respond to, retain, and follow up with customers.</li>
              <li><strong>Merchant services review:</strong> options for PayPal, Cash App, card payments, invoices, booking payments, and other payment tools where appropriate.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom tracking tool:</strong> a practical tracker for jobs, orders, customers, payments, deadlines, follow-up, inventory, or repeat work.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Action Plan:</strong> what to fix, update, set up, streamline, measure, and improve next.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="card-footer">
              <button class="btn btn-gold open-form" data-interest="Bring Home The Bacon">Request This Program</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3>Spread The Word</h3>
            <span class="card-subtitle">Online Presence &amp; Marketing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="tag">July only · limited time</span>
            <p>
              For businesses, creators, educators, makers, and local providers who need to build
              or boost their online presence and reach the right people.
            </p>

            <ul class="plain-list">
              <li><strong>Online presence review:</strong> evaluate what people see when they search, click, message, or visit your page.</li>
              <li><strong>Social media strategy:</strong> structure your profile, page, contact path, and calls to action around what you actually offer.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom SEO:</strong> practical search language tied to your location, service, skill, product, class, or audience.</li>
              <li><strong>Communication strategy:</strong> stronger wording so people understand what you do, who it helps, and what to do next.</li>
              <li><strong>Marketing concepts:</strong> post concepts, scheduled advertising ideas, and promotional angles that fit your business.</li>
              <li><strong>Customer attraction and retention:</strong> organize messaging that helps bring people in and gives them a reason to come back.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Action Plan:</strong> what to update, what to post, what to test, and what to track over the next 30 days.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="card-footer">
              <button class="btn btn-gold open-form" data-interest="Spread The Word">Request This Program</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3>Preach it Teach</h3>
            <span class="card-subtitle">Class, Booking &amp; Payment Setup</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="tag">July only · limited time</span>
            <p>
              For homeschool parents, tutors, enrichment providers, makers, farmers,
              tradespeople, and life-skill teachers ready to offer online sessions or classes.
            </p>

            <ul class="plain-list">
              <li><strong>Class-to-offer setup:</strong> turn what you teach into a clear class, session, workshop, or service people understand.</li>
              <li><strong>Online booking flow:</strong> setup guidance for scheduling links, calendar booking, confirmations, and simple next steps.</li>
              <li><strong>Parent/student intake:</strong> forms that can connect from your website or social media and route to your inbox for quick review.</li>
              <li><strong>Merchant services flow:</strong> align booking, payment links, invoices, or checkout options so payments are easier to manage.</li>
              <li><strong>Social media and YouTube path:</strong> prepare visibility pieces needed to promote the class or session.</li>
              <li><strong>SEO and marketing language:</strong> custom wording, search terms, and promotional concepts for your offer.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Action Plan:</strong> what to set up, what to post, what to link, how to book, and how to start taking requests.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="card-footer">
              <button class="btn btn-gold open-form" data-interest="Preach it Teach">Request This Program</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="payment-plans" class="gold-section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <h2>Payment Plans Are Available</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          We are bringing the American spirit back — one family, one business, one project at a time.
        </p>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px;">
          If your business or family is struggling and you need help accessing these July deals,
          we’re here to help — no questions asked. Just fill out the simple form.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="payment-box">
        <h3>Need a payment plan?</h3>
        <p>
          Select <strong>“I need a payment plan”</strong> on the form and tell us what would make
          the $250 July offer accessible. FFN will review the request and follow up.
        </p>
        <button class="btn btn-black open-form" data-interest="Payment Plan Request">Open Payment Plan Form</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="rrm" class="sage">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="rrm-logo-lockup">
        <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Rebel Ranch Ministries logo">
        <div>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px;">Rebel Ranch Ministries</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Rebel Ranch Ministries is a program aligned with Faith Family & Nature Church.
            It promotes Faith, Family, and Freedom through real-life skills, family-centered learning,
            business education, creation, agriculture, sustainability, food independence, and community-building.
          </p>
