      </div>

      <div class="path-grid">
        <a class="path-tile" href="https://rebel-ranch-academy-hub.brookeritchie.chatgpt.site" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>Rebel Ranch Academy</strong>
          <span>Homesteading, gardening, animal husbandry, sustainability, food independence, trades, and business foundations.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="path-tile" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/creation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
