        <a class="path-tile" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/services.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>Community Service</strong>
          <span>Business, income, paperwork, systems, family support, education direction, and real-life problem solving.</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Faith. Family. Freedom.</h2>
      <div class="freedom-line">The American Dream isn’t dead — it’s dormant. Let’s bring it back to life. Together.</div>

      <div class="buttons" style="justify-content:center;">
        <a class="btn btn-black" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/community.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the Tribe</a>
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn About Us</a>
        <a class="btn btn-black" href="https://rebelranchministries.org/align.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Align With Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <footer>
    <div class="container">
